v1.2.5
- In schema utils added fix to allow null values if not required.

v1.2.6
- Type Date is converted to Type String.

v1.2.7
- Removing file validation for text based formats.

v1.2.8
- Increasing cache cleanup scheduler interval to 10 secs.

v1.2.9
- Minor fix for cache scheduler interval

v2.0.0
- Created from v1.2.9
- env vars renamed from REDIS_* to CACHE_*

Unreleased
- Mongoose 7, 8 and 9 support (still works on Mongoose 6.5.1+):
  - counter.getIdGenerator, transactionIdGenerator and transactionIdGeneratorParallel return async pre hooks (Mongoose 9 no longer passes next()). transactionIdGeneratorParallel no longer runs in parallel.
  - counter.getCount returns a promise and no longer passes a callback to findByIdAndUpdate (removed in Mongoose 7). The optional callback argument still works.
  - counter.generateId is an async function (same resolved value).
  - logToMongo uses collection.insertOne (collection.insert was removed from the MongoDB driver).
  - mongoose moves from dependencies to peerDependencies so the application and this package share one Mongoose instance. A second copy would register the counter model on a connection that is never opened.
